<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">2 ABitrus</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Bit</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 ABitrus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung kufɛ́ afa fɛ́ aBitrus Jɛk</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 ABitrus</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung kufɛ́ afa <optbreak /> fɛ́ aBitrus Jɛk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Kufumung kang ne ni bɔk hom, imi aSiman Bitrus, asam aYeso Kristi, nɛ atom wu bà.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Sak na bayɔng fɛ́ nek kusot kutabat Adakunom, nɛ Anet-Isheshek yit aYeso Kristi Anet-Isheshek yit, ba mi shan atsak kpaf tɛ afiit.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Won Adakunom na ki te yin itek, na tɛ a ki nɔk yin kusonong kukyang shɛrɛk ayɛt irēn Adakunom nɛ aYeso, aTisa yit.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyes ni ikasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Adakunom ayɛt kukyem wu a mi ki nɔk yit kaaki ikyɛng fi in shim yit nek in di nye yit kusot kutabat ni kurēn ayɔng fɛ́ a ki yes yit ni ízɔk ni tek wu. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Ni irèn e ye, a ki nɔk yit nkyɔrɔk ntek makiyi, nek kushii wu fɛ́ a nye, a ki nɔk yit ina, nɔng in di ki sot yit ni nggɔn kuri nfɛ́ Adakunom, ni ma hwyet yit ni nkyɔrɔk nmaane nfɛ́ azatse fi in nes nek ikɔk irɔm.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Nek anɔng, nye yin nyɛk i di barang yin naton inɔɔk atsak yin nggɔn ntek. Naton nggɔn ntek e, irēn; <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />Naton irēn e, itekap ice; naton itekap ice me, iniri; naton iniri me, anyɛk ni ikuus Adakunom; <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />naton anyɛk ikuus Adakunom e, bɛ̀ yin ishim sak na bafidang; naton ishim sak na bafidang e, ishim banet ngma. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Ki i bɛ̀ yin kuri nggɔn nang dot, ni irēn aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, i da ki sak yin ni isot yin vit ita ice na vit ite nyɛk ni ikuus aYeso. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Nek ngma ayɔng fɛ́ da a bɛ̀ nggɔn nang awo, isot a mak yɛrɛ yɛɛt awo, a yet akpatɔn. A mi te burum ni ifuut anɛn wu afɛ́ yame, fɛ́ ba mi ku fuut e.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Nek anɔng, ábaruneng, ban te yin nyɛk i di tonong yin fok, iyes ni ikasa yin yet ifɛ́ tsak. Nek ki i nye yin nkyɔrɔk nang, i da kpa yin awo, <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />i da sɛ yin ishan itek ayɛt igwɔm aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, Anet-Isheshek yit fi ise vit nkum.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itak ibes kufumung ajɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Nek anɔng, in da ya kashon ni in ki yiring yin nkyɔrɔk nang, ngma ne fi iyin rēn ina, nɛ aney fi i mi te yin ayɛt atsak fi i mi sɛ yin. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Imi di i se gyat ni in ki yiring yin ni nkyɔrɔk nang ni in ren resek ni kubut irɔm kang, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />nek in rēn fok ngmash ni in nabak atak, kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi mi di tonong wɛshɛk. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />In da te nyɛk in da di fok, ama fi in mi tseng, i da ya yin kashon ni iyiring yin nkyɔrɔk nang.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Iyit kin ra yit kutomong ni kutsitsɛng imonoso nkyɛng-ashon ashon ni izen fi in kin cɛɛt yit ni iyin azaton agap ni kubɛ́ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi awo, tit in cɛɛt yit azaton ízɔk wu fi in kin di yit. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Nek a kin shan iratek na Ada Adakunom ni izen fi kutɔ kin ne ni ízɔk agwɔm sak ni wu fok, &lt;&lt;Ari hom yong, fi in shim makiyi, a di sas iyɛ ikan gyet awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Iyit ice yit in fok yit kutɔ me ni izen fi in se yit gung ni wu naton ihwyanang ajɛrɛ.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Iyit mi sɛ yit atsak ifɛ̀ batan, i da se gyat i di te yin nhwyɛ ni ide, ti mgbey fi in tsin ron na hwyi ma kadiding te gbey ma àdat isɛng adiding ta mgbey na yɛ yin. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Agbat icɛɛt e yet fok, i se kpaf ni i rēn yin fok, vit itak ibes ikak fi i se ni fumung ajɛrɛ fi ines ayɛt kuyiring atan e. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Nek itak ibes ki mang ne ayɛt kushim anet awe awo, tit banet tas kucɛɛt Adakunom ni irèn fɛ́ Kabik aJɛrɛ ka ba kɔk mo.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Kawɛy bafi itees mbɔɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Awɛt batan mbɔɔs kin se nate banet e, kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ bafi itees mbɔɔs bi se nate yin. Ba bi nɔɔs ni itees mbɔɔs ni nɛt, ba bi ton ni iratek Adakunom iwu yɔng fɛ́ a ka ba shan. Ba da bɛ na kawɛy ziri ziri naton ace bá. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Banet dot bi di kuus irèn nsum bá, ba bi sak bakak na ba nye aduk ncɛɛt azaton irèn atsak. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Ayɛt kuhwye bà, bafi itees mbɔɔs e bi ki yisik yin ni nkyɛng-ashon ashon fɛ́ ba mi monoso. Ba mi sak ishɔt bà i tsin ka ba tot, kawɛy bá tsin ka ba yɛrɛ.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Nek ke Adakunom kin kyem a won batomaza fɛ́ ba kin nye inɛn awo, tit a kin yirik iba sak ari irong.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni ilem aGirik: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ari irong </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yet </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">aTetarɔs.</char></note> A sak iba ni kubong kuhwyining, na ba sot itot ishɔt azɔng, <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />ke da a kin kyem a won kazatse ashon awo, a kin korok akpolol ashi naton banet fɛ́ ba kin se vit Adakunom. Awɛt a bereng anet ishara kusot kutabat, aNuhu nɛ bakak kanakataat; <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />ke Adakunom kin gang nwɔp aSodom nɛ aGomora ni kurong, in sot ntong irong. A sak ina na na sot ikyɛng itees naton ikyɛng fi i bi te na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se vit Adakunom.<verse eid="2PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Ke Adakunom kin hwyet na aLotu anet kusot kutabat, fɛ́ i mi rɔɔn ni nggɔn anyas ágadiring ánet. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Nek anet e kin se nate ba atut na katson, ni ikyɛng e ku tusup kabik ajɛrɛ wu nek kuri nggɔn ibeseng ntsi fɛ́ a yɛrɛ na foos. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Ki i se anɔng, i sot Adakunom rēn irèn iturung bafi nnyim wu ayɛt izot na yit bafi nhwyi ayɛt izot na ba tsin di tot kunom ishɔt bà. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Ishɔt e bi dung risik naton bayɔng fɛ́ ba di kuus aduk ikɔk ishim irɔm, fɛ́ ba byɛs bafɛ́ ashon bà.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Nek ikok ice ni ibun ice bà, banet bang foos nnyim ibɔs mbɔɔs naton batomaza awo, <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />ngma ne anɔng, batomaza me, ngma fɛ́ agap bà wat afɛ́ bafi itees mbɔɔs e, da ba te kukun imonoso ncɛɛt naton ba ashon Adakunom awo. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Awɛt banet e beseng iyerek azaton nkyɔrɔk fi da ba rēn awo. Ba se ti inyam ayit fi i se vit kuyiring, in yɔng fi in nyes ikyɛng fi nrɔm bà tsesek kyek, ba tes ide nek na ba yisik nɛ ba fɛɛs ide, kpaf ti in yame, ba bi ka ba fɛɛs bá.<verse eid="2PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Kyɔn ti iba kin di man banet, itarang bà bi se anɔng bà. Ikyɛng fi iyet nta ni ba yet ikyɛng iduk e nate inom. Kusot ba nate yin yet ikyɛng nsum, i ti yet ikyɛng awey, ba yas na ba sɔs ni iyin na ba nyes ikyɛng fɛ́ ba shim ama ikɔt yin. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Ayisi bà kaakyi izen yet afi itsɛsɛk kujang, ba kyem ba won inɛn awo; ba wɔrɔsɔ bayɔng fɛ́ ba se vit agap, ba mi tees ayɛ bà imak, kawɛy Adakunom tsin ka ba tot. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Ba mi won irèn i tabat e, ba mi nɔ ayit ba tsin di kuus irèn aBalaam arim aBeyo, yɔng fɛ́ a shim itarang kutomong anyas. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Awɛt ijaki ye i kin ku gyɔng naton aduk nggɔn wu, ikyɛng fi da icɛɛt awo, icɛɛt ni kutɔ anet, iroyin na atan e irèn ira kutomong iririm.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Kuri banet bang se tɛ ikang fi ise vit ashi, ti itsutsun iza fi itsombos kok. Aduk ahwyi tsin ka ba tot. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Ba ka ka tsot nanu ni ncɛɛt fi in se vit ice, ba ras kutomong ni nrɔm bà fi in tsɛsɛk inɛn ni ites agunung na bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi kpa hwyet ni kusot bafi mbɔs. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Ba nye ni iba fok ba da sɛ ihwet, ni iba bafi icɛɛt e mo basam ni nggɔn ibeseng, nek anet yet asam naton ikyɛng fi i mi ku te nawop. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Ke ba man hwet ayɛt ibeseng azatse kang nek irēn aTisa yit nɛ Anet-Isheshek yit aYeso Kristi, awɛt ba tɛ ba yit ice bà ayɛt ka, ba tɛ ba ya awɛng ni ba, a sot kudaam bà kufɛ́ ayɔkɔnɔng wat kufi imɛsɛng ba kumaan e. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Ki i kin dung ka ba wat e na ba sot vit irēn kusot kutabat, aza na ba na ba rēn iko, na ba ma tirik itees ntsi fɛ́ ba kin ka ba nabak e kama. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Kucɛɛt ama ikɔt kang yet atsak, &lt;&lt;AKabu tɛ bun ni ikos wu,&gt;&gt; nɛ &lt;&lt;Aza yɔng fɛ́ ba mi so wu, tɛ a nɔ ayɛt afɔm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Kunom ibes wu aTisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Bafidang in, kufumung in kufɛ́ afaa kang sak ni yin. In ki jɛk yin ina, mok in ki yiring yin nkyɔrɔk e, nɔng in da te nyɛk yin ni kuyiring kusot kucɛ́l ngma kusum. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Imi shim ni yiring yin ncɛɛt fɛ́ batan ajɛrɛ aneme man nye, ni kucɛɛt fɛ́ aTisa yit nɛ Anet-Isheshek kin tak na nu batom wu.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Ni imɛsɛng e, i se gbing-gbing ni rēn yin fok, ni nnom igang e, bafi ibyes bi ne, ba bi tonoso ibyes na ba nyes kushim anyas bà. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Ba bi fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Wat kucɛɛt ibɛ́ wu me se kɛ? Badakop yit mang kus neme, kaakyɛ ren tseng kpaf neme fɛ́ ba di tumung kazatse.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Awɛt iba te burum zɔng zɔng fok neme ni kukyem ifɛ̀ Adakunom, kazanɛn di se, ba kin di nye kazatse ayɛt ashi nɛ nate ashi. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />A tɛ yet ne ashi izen e yɔng wu fɛ́ ba kin di gang na kazatse. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Ni ifɛ̀ izining e dɔng fɛ́ ba di bereng kazanɛn nɛ kazatse kang nek kurong, ba sak ina sak kunom ishɔt ni ifɛlɛ banet fɛ́ vit iba ni nnyim Adakunom.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Awɛt iyin bafidang yin, i bi te burum in ni ikyɛng izining deng awo: Kunom kuzining na aTisa se tɛ ayɛ agup azining, nɛ ayɛ agup azining se ti kunom kuzining. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />ATisa se nɔshɔsh ni ishining kushii wu kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ bakak di di awo. A bɛ́ akabɔk ni iyin nek a shim akak na a wey awo tit kaangan na a won anɛn na a tirik sak na Adakunom.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Awɛt kunom ibɛ́ aTisa bi se tɛ akpatang di nes. Kazanɛn bi te bit nek iwɔng igberey. Ngma nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba di nye kurong bi fɛlɛ ina, ba bi yɛs kazatse ni nkyɔrɔk fi in se ayɛt e.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Ayet fok ba bi shosh kaakyi ikyɛng anɔng, akyɛ kuri banet fi i se gyat ni i sot yin ɛ? I se kpaf ni inye yin kusot ajɛrɛ ni kusot fɛ́ Adakunom shim, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />ni tsin di tot yin kunom Adakunom e, di barang yin i tsi ko. Kunom e bi bɛ́ ku fɛlɛ kazanɛn ni kurong, nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba di nye ika bi te vit ni rong. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Awɛt kpaf ti kushii wu, in tsin tang yit ayisi ku di kazanɛn kafas nɛ kazatse kafas, kari bafi kusot kutabat.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Nek anɔng, bafidang in, ni tsin di tot yin nkyɔrɔk e yɔng, nye nyɛk yin da ba bi ki sɛ yin na karìk ke inɛn awo, tit kusot imen iyɛ ni iwu. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Rēn yin fok, akabɔk aTisa yet kawat isheshek, kyɔn tɛ icɛk iyɛ yit aBulus ayɛt kutsitsɛng fɛ́ Adakunom ku nɔk, a kin ki jɛk yin ne. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />A kin jɛk kpaf anɔng ayɛt afumung wu, azaton nkyɔrɔk e nang. Afumung wu bi nkyɔrɔk in kak fi in bi mgbang irēn, nkyɔrɔk nang fɛ́ bafi vit irēn nɛ ba buk-buk nabik, mi shesheng ace icɛɛt e kpaf tɛ fɛ́ ba mi nye ne afumung ajɛrɛ akak, ba di kɔk ice bá kawɛy.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Nek anɔng bafidang in, nek i rēn yin anɔng, nye yin nhwyɛ kɔng ba ki te yin ice kangang ni itees mbɔɔs, ni ma won karɔ katek fi i di nyeseng yin. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Tit ni ya yin kashon ni i rasak ayɛt itek ni irēn aTisa nɛ Anet-Isheshek yit aYeso Kristi. Won ízɔk ni sot ifuu yɔkɔnɔng nɛ ayɛ na ayɛ! Anɔng.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>